%% Lecture reference: L41 "dbt run: Model Selection & Execution Flags"

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as dbt CLI
    participant Parser as dbt Parser
    participant Renderer as dbt Renderer
    participant Adapter as Snowflake Adapter
    participant DB as Snowflake DB

    User->>CLI: dbt run --select activity+
    CLI->>Parser: parse dbt_project.yml + models/
    Parser-->>CLI: AST (Abstract Syntax Tree)
    CLI->>Parser: resolve refs/sources/macros
    Parser->>Renderer: render Jinja -> compiled SQL
    Renderer-->>CLI: compiled SQL per model
    CLI->>Adapter: build DAG (topological order)
    loop For each model in DAG
        Adapter->>DB: CREATE OR REPLACE <relation>
        Adapter->>DB: INSERT INTO <relation> SELECT ...
        DB-->>Adapter: rows affected
    end
    Adapter-->>CLI: run_results.json
    CLI-->>User: 4 models, 12.3s total
